<span class="eyebrow"><i></i><span>Odoo solutions</span></span>
<h1>Services designed around<br/><span class="gradient-text">your real operations</span></h1>
<p>From first consultation to daily support, we help you deploy a practical business platform—not just another piece of software.</p>
</div></section>

<section style="padding-top:25px"><div class="container service-grid">
  <article class="service-card"><div class="icon">◎</div><div><h3>Odoo Implementation</h3><p>A structured setup aligned with your processes, users and priorities.</p><ul><li>Process discovery and solution design</li><li>Application configuration</li><li>Initial data and user setup</li><li>Team training and go-live support</li></ul></div></article>
  <article class="service-card"><div class="icon">⚙</div><div><h3>Customization &amp; Integration</h3><p>Adapt Odoo where your business needs more than standard configuration.</p><ul><li>Custom workflows and automation</li><li>Third-party service integration</li><li>Reports and business dashboards</li><li>Website and online shop connection</li></ul></div></article>
  <article class="service-card"><div class="icon">▤</div><div><h3>Invoicing, Accounting &amp; TGC</h3><p>Build a cleaner financial workflow from quotation to payment follow-up.</p><ul><li>Quotations, invoices and credit notes</li><li>Payment tracking and reminders</li><li>TGC configuration and reporting</li><li>Bank reconciliation support</li></ul></div></article>
  <article class="service-card"><div class="icon">◫</div><div><h3>Retail &amp; Operations</h3><p>Keep stock, purchasing, sales and customer data synchronized.</p><ul><li>Inventory and purchasing</li><li>Point of Sale</li><li>eCommerce and product catalogue</li><li>Fleet, projects and task management</li></ul></div></article>
  <article class="service-card"><div class="icon">◇</div><div><h3>EpayNC &amp; Online Payments</h3><p>Connect local digital payment journeys with invoices, customer portals and eCommerce.</p><ul><li>Customer portal payments</li><li>Online store payment flow</li><li>Secure transaction experience</li><li>Implementation and configuration support</li></ul></div></article>
  <article class="service-card"><div class="icon">✦</div><div><h3>AI Assistant for Odoo</h3><p>Help teams find information, complete tasks and understand daily workflows more quickly.</p><ul><li>Invoice and quotation guidance</li><li>Overdue invoice lookup</li><li>TGC process assistance</li><li>First-level user support</li></ul></div></article>
  <article class="service-card"><div class="icon">☁</div><div><h3>Hosting &amp; Security</h3><p>A managed environment built for reliable everyday access.</p><ul><li>Secure cloud hosting</li><li>Automated backups</li><li>SSL and domain configuration</li><li>Updates and platform monitoring</li></ul></div></article>
  <article class="service-card"><div class="icon">✦</div><div><h3>Support &amp; Training</h3><p>Help your users adopt Odoo confidently and get answers quickly.</p><ul><li>Remote functional support</li><li>User and administrator training</li><li>Process optimization reviews</li><li>Continuous improvement roadmap</li></ul></div></article>
</div></section>

